e":"Industrial Standards Library","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/industrial-standards-library.md","line":43},{"title":"Scheduling standards","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/scheduling-standards.md","line":51},{"title":"Skill-based task management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/skill-based-task-management.md","line":59},{"title":"ServiceNow Store","target":"https://store.servicenow.com/sn_appstore_store.do#!/store/home","line":66},{"title":"ServiceNow Store version history release notes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/bundle/store-release-notes/page/release-notes/store/sn-store-release-notes.html","line":66},{"title":"Industrial Connected Workforce Core","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/industrial-connected-workforce-core-landing-page.md","line":79},{"title":"Industrial Guided Tasks","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/industrial-standards-landing-page.md","line":83},{"title":"ICW Mobile Experience","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/industrial-connected-workforce/icw-mobile-exp-landing-page.md","line":87},{"title":"Industrial Connected Workforce release notes","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/release-notes/industrial-connected-workforce-rn-landing.md","line":92}],"metadata":{"title":"Industrial Standards release notes","description":"The ServiceNow Industrial Standards application provides a centralized, governed framework to define, publish, and maintain operational standards across plants and production lines. This 